# 🐾 Pet Adoption Platform

A web platform for pet adoption, built with **Node.js**, **Oracle Database**, and a modular frontend.

---

How to Install and Run Locally
1. Clone the Repository

git clone https://github.com/username/repository-name.git
cd TW_2025

2. Requirements
- Node.js (v16.x or higher)
Download: https://nodejs.org/

- Oracle Database (Express Edition)
Used for data storage.
Download: https://www.oracle.com/database/technologies/xe-downloads.html

- MailDev (for email testing)
  npm install -g maildev

- Install project dependencies
  npm install

3. Environment Configuration
Create a .env file in the root of the project.

Add the following variables:
DB_USER=pot_user
DB_PASSWORD=your_password
DB_CONNECTION_STRING=localhost:1521/XEPDB1

API_PORT=8080

JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret
TOKEN_EXPIRATION=1d

EMAIL_HOST=localhost
EMAIL_PORT=1025
EMAIL_SECURE=false

GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_google_client_secret
GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:8080/api/auth/google/callback


4. Running the App
- Start MailDev
  maildev
Access the MailDev interface at: http://localhost:1080
           
-  Start the server     
  npm start

5. Access the App
Open your browser and go to:
http://localhost:8080




           
